e draw a vertical arrow through the region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14054607/assets/95a6d9b0bc464c719311dc900967ebd06a3aa3d3004cfe5303359eecb20551e7.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,{e}^{x}\\le y\\le e}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{e}^{x}}^{e}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14054607/state.json" "file_sha256" "70dfc2d3901190177f89e5518ec1fd1e8ae9dad5f3a3be9f25ff404feb7c8814"} {"question" "q-81336" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14054607/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6fc39514b7819b896c748a22fda886a33b909726f8e049309dbb73bddc29d37f"} {"question" "q-81336" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14054607/state.json" "file_sha256" "70dfc2d3901190177f89e5518ec1fd1e8ae9dad5f3a3be9f25ff404feb7c8814"} {"question" "q-81336" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{e}^{{e}^{x}}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx"] ["math" "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{e}^{x}}^{e}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx"] ["math" "{\\int }_{e}^{{e}^{x}}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx"] ["math" "{\\int }_{{e}^{x}}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{e}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx"] ["math" "{\\int }_{{e}^{x}}^{e}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home